  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **`TeventStore.PersistMigrations` persists each taggregate's migrations in a transaction at `ReadCommitted`, as a unit of work runs,** rather than at `TransactionScope`'s default, `Serializable`, which it had used by omission since units of work moved to `ReadCommitted`. Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.PostgreSql now reads a taggregate's history for update in the transaction, and refuses a higher isolation level, at which the read would miss tevents committed while it waited for the taggregate's lock.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.13.0-internal (was 0.12.1-internal), Compze.Tessaging 0.14.0-alpha (was 0.13.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
